<item>
            <title>[BOOKKEEPER-898] Underreplication doesn&apos;t get triggered when a read only bookie is shut down</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/BOOKKEEPER-898</link>
                <project id="12311293" key="BOOKKEEPER">Bookkeeper</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The auditor doesn&apos;t pick up a bookie shut down from read only mode. The watcher on child nodes of &quot;/ledgers/available&quot; node on zk doesn&apos;t get triggered if there is any change in the children of any of those child nodes (&quot;/ledgers/available/readonly&quot;).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Solution:&lt;br/&gt;
The auditor needs to set another child watcher on read only bookie node on zk.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
